<h1 id=3D"BDHClassification&amp;MaskingDesign-document_information"><span c=
lass=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"BDHClassification&amp;MaskingDesign-d=
ocument_information"></span></h1>
<h1 id=3D"BDHClassification&amp;MaskingDesign-1.DocumentInformation">1. Doc=
ument Information</h1>
<p><br></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 73=
.1237%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 20.2807%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 79.7145%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Document Status</p></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;"><em><span class=3D"status-macro aui=
-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">ENDORSED</span></em></span></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Purpose*</p></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Document the proposed BDH Classification &amp; Masking using Alatio=
n as the tool to provide masking instructions in the form of classification=
s &amp; Snowflake as the tool to apply the Masking Rules.</p>
     <p>The BDH Classification &amp; Masking design includes:</p>
     <ol>
      <li>Using Alation as the tool to provide masking instructions, in the=
 form of classifications</li>
      <li>Using Snowflake as the tool to apply the masking rules</li>
     </ol>
     <p>The approach is that classifications defined in Alation (e.g. Publi=
c, Confidential, Highly Confidential) will be synchronized and applied as t=
ags in Snowflake, driving dynamic masking policies that control data visibi=
lity for different user roles and personas. The design ensures a consistent=
, automated link between metadata governance in Alation and data access enf=
orcement in Snowflake, enabling secure, role-based access to data across al=
l environments.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Author*</p></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-username=3D"943=
761" href=3D"/display/~943761" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1371341939" data-=
linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" data-b=
ase-url=3D"https://confluence.nz.thenational.com">Bradley Freedman</a>&nbsp=
;</p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Version</p></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>1.0</p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
